Title: Monthly electricity usage at Australian Antarctic Stations

Authors:
  - GUY RATCLIFFE (TECHNICAL CONTACT)
  - ROBERT SHEERS (TECHNICAL CONTACT)
  - JEREMY BONNICE (INVESTIGATOR, DIF AUTHOR)

